[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":94},"routes/item",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8},"item",{"_9":10,"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":-5,"_20":21,"_22":23,"_24":25,"_26":27,"_28":-5,"_29":30,"_31":25,"_32":33,"_34":35,"_36":37,"_38":39,"_40":41,"_42":-5,"_41":43,"_44":45,"_46":-5,"_47":-5,"_48":49,"_50":51,"_52":53,"_54":55,"_56":57,"_58":59,"_60":39,"_61":62,"_63":-5,"_64":39,"_65":66},"id","bgeyz2y0srtxt5l4ng5h0xqeh","revision",1,"title","亚马逊品牌旗舰店优化策略","originalTitle","Most brand storefronts on Amazon are just a list of products.","summary","作者认为，大多数亚马逊品牌旗舰店只是产品列表；好的旗舰店按产品线组织，配有真实横幅和虚拟捆绑包。作者称这是品牌获得复购客户和提升客单价的方式，但这是其个人观点，未提供独立验证。作者还建议，在向对方提出任何要求之前，先修复品牌旗舰店，以此展示价值；这是作者的经验性建议，并非保证效果。来源为卖家顾问Dan Boufford的X账号，存在相关商业利益，并非独立测评。","reason","source",{"_9":87,"_88":89,"_90":91,"_92":39,"_93":-5},"links",{"_84":85,"_66":86},"publishedAt","2026-10-14T23:28:07.000Z","publishedPrecision","timestamp","calendarDate","discoveredAt","2026-10-17T16:14:18.114Z","timelineAt","category","advertising","tags",[80,81,82,83],"score",18,"selected",false,"channel","x","story",{"_71":72,"_73":51,"_74":75,"_76":77,"_78":-5,"_44":79},"media",[],"byline","detailedGuide","readingMode","full","author","1000asins","language","en","body",{"_67":-5,"_66":68,"_69":-5,"_70":62},"outline",[],"relatedStories",[],"indexable","markdownAvailable",true,"group","hasTranslation","bodyLanguage","original","zh","<p>Most brand storefronts on Amazon are just a list of products.</p><p>A good one is organized by product line, with real banners and virtual bundles. It's how a brand gets repeat buyers and upsells.</p><p>Fixing a brand's storefront is an easy way to show value before you ask for anything.</p>","zhKind","complete","authorName","Dan Boufford","handle","avatarUrl","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg","avatarSrcSet","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 48w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 96w","quoted",[],"广告/运营","Listing优化","品牌","亚马逊","aihot","/items/bgeyz2y0srtxt5l4ng5h0xqeh","https://x.com/1000asins/status/2110513010221404184","x-dan-boufford","name","X · Dan Boufford","kind","x_search","firstParty","iconUrl",{"_95":96},"changelogVersion","2026-10-09T22:08"]
